#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "541672"
msgid "Area scan, as well as shield detection,\ncomplete."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "542420"
msgid "Was that not #C236196003Rin#CDEF just now? She appeared\nunwell though…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "542688"
msgid "A listless walk.\nWhat happened to that woman?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "543252"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, keep chasing her.\nLet's figure out what she's doing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "543368"
msgid "I caught up to #C236196003Rin#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "543572"
msgid "More… prepare more blood, #C236196003Rin#CDEF…\nThat's what #C236196003Lancer#CDEF said…\nAs her Master, I have to obey, properly…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "543724"
msgid "I wonder, why am I doing something so\npainful…?\nI just became Queen too…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "543968"
msgid "#C236196003Rin#CDEF continuously mutters to herself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "544100"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF…!?\nH-how long have you been standing there!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "544352"
msgid "It has been a while now. Ah, but pay no heed\nto us. Please, go ahead and continue with your\npleasant self-harm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "544484"
msgid "\"For a slight minute or so,\" I replied."
msgstr ""

