#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "551096"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "551200"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "551336"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "551380"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "551520"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "551640"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "551740"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "551932"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "551996"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "552076"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "552192"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "552320"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "552364"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "552492"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "552620"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "552728"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "552816"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "552908"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553056"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553140"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553272"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553372"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553532"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553660"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553752"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553884"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "553984"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "554192"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "554316"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "554448"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "554540"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "554664"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "554744"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "554848"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "554936"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "555056"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "555140"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "555220"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "555288"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "555328"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "555360"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "555392"
msgid "Did you see that? That was her just now.\nShe was looking pale though…\nMaybe some food didn't agree with her?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "555504"
msgid "Just now, that zombie-looking thing\ncrossing over there was #C236196003Rin#CDEF.\nWe've found some more delightful trouble!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "555628"
msgid "We have also confirmed that was\none of #C236196003Rin#CDEF's other selves."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "555704"
msgid "Her Servant doesn't seem to be around either.\nThis is your chance to obtain her #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nPlease pursue her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "555824"
msgid "Like #C236196003Leo#CDEF said as well: she's clearly acting\nstrange. Her face is pale, and her eyes look\nempty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "555936"
msgid "In one hand she held a syringe,\nwhich she was sticking into her arm.\nWhat―――on Earth―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556032"
msgid "Ahh! But if I defy her,\nshe'll beat me with that long thing of hers…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556104"
msgid "That girl always has to have her way, but she's\nstrong… and a noble… and that tail… When I\nhear her orders I feel, like, really―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556244"
msgid "It's unclear what she's doing, but it's dangerous.\nThere's no way I can leave her like that…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556340"
msgid "Since just now. Getting hit with something\nlong―being frustrated, but it feels good―\nsince around when you mentioned all that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556472"
msgid "Since just about a minute ago.\nWhat the hell are you doing…? Looks clearly\nlike something not good for your body…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556588"
msgid "I could only make out bits and pieces of what she said,\nbut could it be that #C236196003Rin#CDEF is being abused by #C236196003Lancer#CDEF…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556732"
msgid "J-just leave me alone!\nThis is a way of making money, that's it!\nThis has nothing to do with you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556832"
msgid "You asked for it! Come on out!\nAttack these voyeurs!\nGive them a HARSH beating they won't forget!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556932"
msgid "Ergh, an enemy!\nI'll rout it, Master!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "556972"
msgid "Are you some underling in desperation?\nWhat a waste of time…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "557036"
msgid "Oh. #C236196003Rin#CDEF is so energetic now♪. Okay, okay. Now\nmy turn… Approach not you useless bureaucrat!\nHave you not seen my Darling's family crest!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "557192"
msgid "Hmph. Has that money system she boasted of\nsold out? That spoils the fun.\nDrive this thing out, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "557316"
msgid "Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF got away, huh?\n…looks like this one is quite different\nfrom the others up until now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "557432"
msgid "There are still signs of this #C236196003Rin#CDEF in the\nLabyrinth. Let us try to search the area and\ncorner her a little more at all costs."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "557576"
msgid "Return to the previous floor?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "557608"
msgid "Return to previous floor."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "557636"
msgid "Return to the old school."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "557664"
msgid "That's not a complexion fit for a beautiful girl.\nPraetor, hurry and catch up to her!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "557752"
msgid "Rin, what are you doing…!?"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "557780"
msgid "Oh dear, Rin is into some bad stuff.\nWe should stop her quickly, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "557880"
msgid "Hahaha, I think you misunderstand, mongrel.\nIt seems to me like she's enjoying herself."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "557968"
msgid "Rin's signal is just up ahead."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "558000"
msgid "This structure seems different from everything else\nso far. Please be extra cautious."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "558088"
msgid "Haa, haa… How many times has it been now,\nI wonder…? I've gone back and forth right up\nto my threshold…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "558196"
msgid "Ahaha… So cold―so dizzy… but I've got no\nchoice, yeah. Orders are orders. Orders are\nabsolute―this is all due to my orders…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "558328"
msgid "I should go collect more, at least…\nI have to deliver it soon…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "558396"
msgid "This Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF IS acting strange after all.\nIt looks like she hasn't noticed us\nintruding yet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "558512"
msgid "The shadows enveloping the castle have deepened,\nI see… Praetor, be on guard. Something\noverpowering is here before us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "558636"
msgid "…looks like this is our last stop. I feel a\nremarkably large pressure, but… no, rather\nthan pressure, could this be… rejection?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "558768"
msgid "Wooow. At last, she shows what she is really\nmade of. This is a complex structure now, I see.\nIt is not called a \"Labyrinth\" for nothing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "558908"
msgid "Well, now. The atmosphere is different―a\nhostile type that is no longer being concealed.\nDo not get careless, mongrel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "559028"
msgid "There are many signs of hostile enemies.\nAdditionally, two shields have been identified."
msgstr ""

